{"4974960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Station - Baku", "steam_appid": 4974960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Abandoned Baku Metro</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned metro stations, navigate dark tunnels, scavenge for supplies, and fight to escape the nightmare beneath the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974960/extras/c157aa63847819bd08b7630bf3f9f240.poster.avif?t=1785575735\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974960/extras/c157aa63847819bd08b7630bf3f9f240.webm?t=1785575735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974960/extras/c157aa63847819bd08b7630bf3f9f240.mp4?t=1785575735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight. Explore. Survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face terrifying creatures, manage limited resources, solve puzzles, and uncover the mystery behind the outbreak.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person Survival Horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle Solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974960/extras/fae90b8cb9ef795063a2b760d0e2e4c4.poster.avif?t=1785575735\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974960/extras/fae90b8cb9ef795063a2b760d0e2e4c4.webm?t=1785575735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shar